    <h1>Design system</h1>
    <p class="lead">The colors, fonts, sizes and patterns the site is built from ("Blueprint"). Every value lives in <code>src/static/css/tokens.css</code>; change it there and it changes everywhere. This blue block is the hero: brand blue with a drafting grid, white text and an amber action.</p>
    <div class="button-row">
      <a class="button" href="#">Amber action on blue</a>
