    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Colors</h2>
    <p>Contrast is measured against WCAG 2.2: normal text needs 4.5:1, large text (24px+, or 19px+ bold), icons and form field outlines need 3:1.</p>
    <ul class="swatches">
      <li><span style="background:#006dff"></span><strong>Electric blue</strong><code>--color-brand</code> #006dff<br>Header, heroes, closing band, buttons · white text 4.5:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#0062e6"></span><strong>Deep blue</strong><code>--color-brand-deep</code> #0062e6<br>Bottom of the hero gradient · white text 5.4:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#0058d6"></span><strong>Blue for text</strong><code>--color-accent-text</code> #0058d6<br>Eyebrows, labels, links · 6.2:1 on white</li>
      <li><span style="background:#ffc21a"></span><strong>Safety amber</strong><code>--color-amber</code> #ffc21a<br>Main action on blue, markers, accents on navy · navy text 10.2:1. Never text on white.</li>
      <li><span style="background:#ffd352"></span><strong>Light amber</strong><code>--color-amber-light</code> #ffd352<br>Big numbers on blue only · 3.2:1</li>
      <li><span style="background:#021b4e"></span><strong>Deep field navy</strong><code>--color-text</code> <code>--color-dark</code> #021b4e<br>Headings, navy bands, footer · 16.5:1 on white</li>
      <li><span style="background:#33466b"></span><strong>Steel</strong><code>--color-body</code> #33466b<br>Body copy · 9.4:1 on white, 8.5:1 on ice</li>
      <li><span style="background:#4e5f80"></span><strong>Muted</strong><code>--color-muted</code> #4e5f80<br>Secondary text · 6.4:1 on white</li>
      <li><span style="background:#edf4ff"></span><strong>Ice</strong><code>--color-surface</code> #edf4ff<br>Alternate sections, panels, icon circles</li>
      <li><span style="background:#d3e2f8"></span><strong>Border</strong><code>--color-border</code> #d3e2f8<br>Card outlines and dividers (decorative)</li>
      <li><span style="background:#7389b0"></span><strong>Field outline</strong><code>--color-border-input</code> #7389b0<br>Form fields · 3.5:1 on white</li>
      <li><span style="background:#b5c6e6"></span><strong>Text on navy</strong><code>--color-on-dark</code> #b5c6e6<br>Body text on navy bands · 9.6:1</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

